            "heading": "GDPR & FERPA Compliant, Secure Your Privacy",
            "text": "<p>No conversations are used for training or shared with anyone. We fully comply with the strictest standards, including GDPR and FERPA, to protect your data. Whether it's business secrets or family moments.</p>"
